             290                     
             291                       ! Lookup tables for convective adjustment code
             292                       !
             293                       ! D. Salmond, CRAY (UK), August 1991, original code
             294                       ! L. Kornblueh, MPI, April 2003, cleanup and move of table setup code
             295                       !                                from setphys.f90 in module
